//gta6ops.com/story/phil/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"president-russo":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/president-russo/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"the-pretender":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/the-pretender/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"real-dimez":{powerpyx:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-bae-luxe-roxy-dimez-characters/",portrait:"https://www.powerpyx.com/wp-content/uploads/gta-6-dimez.jpg",evidence:"Individual profile"},"drequan-priest":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/drequan-priest/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"nico-vape-smoke-shop":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/nico-vape-smoke-shop/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"vanessa-bayside-tenant":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/vanessa-bayside-tenant/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"dave-circles-of-hell":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/dave-circles-of-hell/",evidence:"Individual profile"},"mister-mangrove":{ops:"https://gta6ops.com/story/mister-mangrove/",evidence:"Individual profile"}},Ro={"jason-duval":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/jason-duval/",text:"The opening playable segment is Gone Fishing, after Lucia\u2019s prologue. Jason\u2019s connections later extend to Dre\u2019Quan, Raul and Kordell; reports describe several possible endings rather than one fixed outcome.",fields:{"Playable introduction":"Gone Fishing","Story outcome":"Dependent on player choices"}},"cal-hampton":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/cal-hampton/",text:"Cal helps get the house ready in Feng Shui and spends time fishing with Jason. Although Jason later asks him for help with a hard drive, Cal is unable to decrypt it.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Gone Fishing; Unwanted Attention; Feng Shui",Interests:"Fishing, radio communications, video games"}},"brian-heder":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/brian-heder/",text:"Brian steps away from his operation in Chapter 1 but remains in contact. The couple encounters him again in Chapter 3, and he facilitates an introduction to Pilot Pete in Company Property.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Gone Fishing; Hey Arnold!; Company Property",Business:"Boatyard and rental properties"}},"kenton-rees":{source:"https://www.gtaviceguides.com/wiki/characters/",text:"Island Dreams is Kenton\u2019s dive business. The gameplay guide describes his loss of a recovery permit and Jason\u2019s subsequent wreck-search work.",fields:{Business:"Island Dreams","Documented appearance":"Island Dreams"}},"bret-vogel":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/bret",text:"GTABase identifies Bret as the founder of Killtelligence, a hunting business in northern Leonida. His hunting assignment is connected to the Fair Game achievement.",fields:{Business:"Killtelligence","Related achievement":"Fair Game"}},freddie:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/freddie",text:"Freddie lives in a fortified property north of Lake Leonida. GTABase reports an optional follow-up challenge called Retest Freddie\u2019s Defenses, with a weather-related unlock.",fields:{Location:"North Leonard County","Documented side mission":"Retest Freddie\u2019s Defenses","Occupation / affiliation":"Prepper and podcaster"}},rita:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/rita",text:"Rita\u2019s readings are available to both protagonists. They can comment on completed activities, relationship dynamics and the player\u2019s criminal profile; GTABase lists an optional $50 fee.",fields:{Location:"Grayson, southwest Lummox County","Occupation / affiliation":"Palm reader","Reported optional fee":"$50"}},"frankie-delight":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/frankie-delight",text:"Vicki works for Frankie at Delights. Lucia encounters him in Girls\u2019 Trip; the club features again in Afternoon Delight.",fields:{Business:"Delights, Port Gellhorn","Documented appearances":"Girls\u2019 Trip; Afternoon Delight"}},wyman:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/characters/gta-6/wyman",text:"Wyman\u2019s World Auto Salvage Co. is associated with his classic-car restoration commission. GTABase identifies that particular commission as Ultimate Edition content and lists his Chapter 2 story appearances separately.",fields:{Business:"Wyman\u2019s World Auto Salvage Co.","Documented appearances":"Coffee Break; Thrillbillies","Edition-specific content":"Wyman\u2019s Classic Car Collection (Ultimate Edition)"}},"papa-audacity":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/papa-audacity",text:"The AudaCity brand includes a cryptocurrency and a public stunt campaign. The optional storyline begins in Chapter 3 at Ocean Beach and runs through six jobs, ending at a brand launch event.",fields:{Brand:"AudaCity","Side mission strand":"The Unknown Stuntman and subsequent jobs",Chapter:"3"}},"pilot-pete":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/pilot-pete",text:"GTABase documents a Jason-exclusive optional aviation strand beginning in Chapter 4. Completing the strand contributes to the Strangers & Freaks trophy.",fields:{"Side mission chapter":"4","Playable character for strand":"Jason","Related achievement":"Strangers & Freaks"}},"yasmani-cabrera":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/yasmani",text:"His Chapter 3 optional assignments involve a range of targets including jewelry shops and payday lenders. GTABase distinguishes his jobs from the strands required for the Strangers & Freaks trophy.",fields:{"Side mission chapter":"3","Strangers & Freaks trophy requirement":"Not required (GTABase)"}},"nicole-park":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/nicole-park",text:"Raul recruits Nicole for her knowledge of Sinfrontera National Bank\u2019s security systems. Jason and Lucia are involved in bringing her into the operation.",fields:{Specialty:"Bank security",Employer:"Sinfrontera National Bank"}},"petra-navarro":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/characters/gta-6/petra-navarro",text:"Petra serves as Megamundo\u2019s chief operating officer. Valentina introduces the protagonists to her at the company\u2019s building opening; GTABase identifies Andr\xe9s as her husband and Rafa as their son.",fields:{Occupation:"Megamundo COO",Family:"Andr\xe9s de Le\xf3n (husband); Rafa (son)"}},vicki:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/vicki",text:"Vicki resides at the Starlet Motel and works at Delights. Her association with Lucia begins in Girls\u2019 Trip and continues into Afternoon Delight.",fields:{Residence:"Starlet Motel, Kelly County",Workplace:"Delights","Documented appearances":"Girls\u2019 Trip; Afternoon Delight"}},andy:{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-andy-character/",text:"Andy helps Lucia prepare for release in the first chapter. In Chapter 3 she moves into a house in Leonard County and becomes Lucia\u2019s contact for the Cellerica storyline, which includes Peach! and Puff Puff Pass.",fields:{"Documented side storyline":"Cellerica","Related achievement":"Road to Rehabilitation","Playable character for strand":"Lucia"}},arnold:{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-arnold-character/",text:"Arnold\u2019s dealings with Brian deteriorate in Hey Arnold!. PowerPyx records two possible outcomes for their confrontation, so his fate should not be treated as fixed.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Hey Arnold!","Story outcome":"Player-dependent"}},"benedict-halifax":{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-benedict-halifax-character/",text:"At the Capri antique shop, Halifax privately proposes exchanging a watch for the statue. Accepting or declining produces different follow-up objectives; PowerPyx reports that the overarching story outcome is unchanged.",fields:{Location:"Capri antique shop","Documented mission":"Dubious Provenance","Story interaction":"Optional trade decision"}},charles:{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-charles-character/",text:"PowerPyx identifies Charles as Darnell\u2019s brother. His apartment and personal belongings become part of the investigation in Here, Kitty Kitty.",fields:{Family:"Darnell (brother)","Documented mission":"Here, Kitty Kitty"}},dook:{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-dook-character/",text:"Dook meets Dre\u2019Quan and the protagonists in Dealer\u2019s Choice. Their conversation suggests an established friendship; his work is connected to Tyrone Russo.",fields:{Affiliation:"Tyrone Russo","Documented mission":"Dealer\u2019s Choice"}},"eddie-acosta":{source:"https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-eddie-acosta-character/",text:"Eddie promotes a cryptocurrency scheme at the hotel in Pool Day. His subsequent party encounter involves a player decision about a purported investment, and is separate from the main plot.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Pool Day; Attend Eddie Acosta\u2019s Party",Chapter:"4"}}};const Po={"kevin-kueh":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-kevin-kueh/",text:"GTA6DATA places Kevin at the bridge rendezvous at the start of Bird in the Hand, before the mission moves to the boat and hangar.",fields:{"Documented scene":"Bridge rendezvous, Bird in the Hand"}},wyman:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-wyman/",text:"At the Starlet Motel parking lot, Wyman guides Lucia through a throttle exercise beside a raised car; the recorded interaction increases her Focus.",fields:{"Documented scene":"Starlet Motel parking lot","Gameplay context":"Focus exercise"}},dobbs:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-dobbs/",text:"During Island Dreams, Jason encounters Dobbs trapped underwater at a wreck and assists him back toward the boat.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Island Dreams","Documented appearance":"Underwater rescue"}},donnie:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-donnie/",text:"In Gone Fishing, Jason finds Donnie restrained inside a Kingfishers shack. A later message and separate mailbox payment follow the rescue.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Gone Fishing","Documented scene":"Kingfishers shack"}},chester:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-chester/",text:"GTA6DATA records Chester speaking to Linda at the Starlet Motel desk about a pineapple he left behind; Linda warns him about property damage.",fields:{"Documented location":"Starlet Motel reception"}},"drequan-priest":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-drequan-priest/",text:"Recorded scenes show Dre\u2019Quan moving between the studio and meetings involving Royce, illustrating his work arranging bookings and managing the label\u2019s artists.",fields:{"Business affiliation":"Only Raw Records"}},linda:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-linda/",text:"At the Starlet Motel desk, Linda discusses payment and the person Lucia is looking for. Chester also approaches her with a separate complaint.",fields:{Workplace:"Starlet Motel",Occupation:"Receptionist"}},mandy:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-mandy/",text:"In Pipework, Mandy asks Jason to repair her sink during a rent visit and offers him a box she says contains belongings of her father. The contents are not established.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Pipework","Documented location":"Peach Palm Drive"}},"lori-heder":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-lori-heder/",text:"GTA6DATA records Lori with Brian at his home and later on an airboat during Swamped, where Jason frees her.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Swamped","Business affiliation":"Brian Heder\u2019s boatyard"}},"moses-mo-watkins":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-moses-watkins/",text:"Moses guides Lucia through registering her first personal vehicle at Watkins Auto Parts, connecting his workshop role to the ownership tutorial.",fields:{Business:"Watkins Auto Parts","Gameplay context":"Personal vehicle registration"}},"danny-the-night-manager":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-danny-the-night-manager/",text:"Lucia mentions that the night manager rented her a room without requiring ID. Linda later offers to send Danny to service it; a separate gameplay route names him in the painkiller search.",fields:{Workplace:"Starlet Motel","Documented appearance":"Mentioned during Discharge Time",Occupation:"Night manager"}},"katerina-rosselli":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-katerina-rosselli-kat/",text:"Kat is beside Mattia in the opening penthouse sequence of VC Baby. The subsequent decision and route depend on the player\u2019s choice.",fields:{"Documented mission":"VC Baby"}},"mattia-tauro":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-mattia-tauro/",text:"In VC Baby, the penthouse meeting with Kat presents a decision involving Mattia. Choosing to help him leads to a hospital sequence.",fields:{"Documented mission":"VC Baby","Story interaction":"Player-dependent route"}},dardan:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-dardan/",text:"Recorded gameplay places Dardan in the Protective Custody handoff; his key fob is also named as an objective in the hospital branch of VC Baby.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Protective Custody; VC Baby"}},"pilot-pete":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-pilot-pete/",text:"In Clear Skies, Pete leads Jason by air to another airstrip during the search for Donnie.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Clear Skies"}},vicki:{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-vicki/",text:"In the motel and Delights sequences, Vicki discusses collecting her pay and points Lucia toward Dunk. The motel encounter takes place in room 10.",fields:{"Documented location":"Starlet Motel, room 10"}},"brian-heder":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-brian-heder/",text:"GTA6DATA records Brian asking Jason to collect Cal after Arnold stops responding. In a separate introduction, Brian describes himself to Lucia as Jason\u2019s boss, friend, mentor and landlord.",fields:{"Documented scene":"Crastenburg pool bar"}},"officer-gutierrez":{source:"https://gta6data.com/gta-6-character-officer-gutierrez/",text:"Sergeant Galeki names Gutierrez alongside Jackson at the Grassrivers visitor center before Jason and Lucia are questioned in Tourist Trap. The source does not isolate a portrait.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Tourist Trap","Documented location":"Grassrivers Visitor Center"}},"lorena-caminos":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/lorena-caminos/",text:"During Chapter 3, Lucia can send money to Lorena twice. Lorena keeps her informed about Tommy, then asks her to stop the large transfers after the bank raises concerns.",fields:{"Family connection":"Lucia\u2019s aunt; Tommy\u2019s caregiver","Documented story chapter":"3"},relations:["lucia-caminos","tommy-tomas"]},karim:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/karim/",text:"Raul mentions Karim in First Impressions, before Jason meets him in Crosstown Traffic. GTA6Ops identifies his technical contribution to the equipment used in Credit Check.",fields:{Occupation:"Technical specialist","Documented appearances":"First Impressions; Crosstown Traffic; Credit Check"},relations:["raul-bautista","jason-duval"]},"rafa-de-leon-navarro":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/rafa-de-leon-navarro/",text:"Rafa is introduced during Adventures in Babysitting and becomes the focus of Child\u2019s Play. His interest in games and streaming continues during the rescue; the documented account says he returns to his parents.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Adventures in Babysitting; Child\u2019s Play",Family:"Andr\xe9s de Le\xf3n (father); Petra Navarro (mother); C\xe9sar Navarro (grandfather)",Interests:"Video games and streams"},relations:["andres-de-leon","petra-navarro","cesar-navarro"]},"kordell-grant":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/kordell-grant/",text:"Kordell\u2019s group comprises Raina, Cisco and Nate. Their training takes place around Ajax Gym and Lawton Theater; Heavy Lifting introduces him, and Lucia\u2019s undercover involvement continues until VCIA Takedown.",fields:{"Documented locations":"Ajax Gym; Lawton Theater","Documented appearances":"Heavy Lifting; VCIA Takedown","Occupation / affiliation":"Leader of Kordell\u2019s crew"},relations:["raina-koleva","francisco-cisco-delgado","nathan-nate-bozer","lucia-caminos"]},"deputy-sarah-fitzroy":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/sarah-fitzroy/",text:"Fitzroy initially escorts Jason into custody. During the attack in Protective Custody she releases him, is wounded and survives the documented sequence. Her assistance does not amount to a legal pardon.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Protective Custody","Documented outcome":"Survives the station sequence"},relations:["jason-duval","captain-aldo-mendez"]},"giorgio-gallo":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/giorgio-gallo/",text:"GTA6Ops identifies Bilgeco as Giorgio\u2019s shipping company. Mattia arranges the couple\u2019s meeting with him, and a lost shipment puts Giorgio under pressure from the Albanian organization.",fields:{Business:"Bilgeco","Documented location":"Pegassi Towers, Tequesta Retreat"},relations:["mattia-tauro","dardan"]},felipe:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/felipe/",text:"Felipe supplies transport and a garage during the crew\u2019s preparations. After leaving Raul, he can be confronted in Bad Driver!; the player\u2019s choice determines whether he survives and later offers a vehicle.",fields:{Occupation:"Getaway driver","Documented appearances":"Credit Check; Safe Word; Bad Driver!","Story outcome":"Player-dependent"},relations:["raul-bautista","andrea","jason-duval"]},"vinny-capsik":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/vinny-capsik/",text:"Vinny works as Giorgio\u2019s MMA trainer and appears at the penthouse gym in Bird in the Hand. GTA6Ops also identifies a separate request to Lucia in Doggie Bag.",fields:{Occupation:"MMA trainer","Documented appearances":"Bird in the Hand; Doggie Bag"},relations:["giorgio-gallo","liz-jackson","kevin-kueh"]},"nathan-nate-bozer":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/nate-bozer/",text:"Nate introduces Lucia to Ajax Gym in Heavy Lifting. Later, selling body oil and spending time together builds his trust, which helps her gain access to Kordell\u2019s group.",fields:{"Documented location":"Ajax Gym","Documented mission":"Heavy Lifting","Occupation / affiliation":"Kordell\u2019s crew"},relations:["kordell-grant","raina-koleva","lucia-caminos"]},"francisco-cisco-delgado":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/francisco-delgado/",text:"Cisco first appears at Ajax Gym in Heavy Lifting. During a drive he tells Lucia that he attended clown school; this is a self-reported detail, not evidence of a professional clown career.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Heavy Lifting","Documented location":"Ajax Gym","Personal history":"Attended clown school (self-reported dialogue)"},relations:["kordell-grant","nathan-nate-bozer","raina-koleva","lucia-caminos"]},"raul-bautista":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/raul-bautista/",text:"Chapter 3 brings the protagonists into Raul\u2019s specialist crew. Credit Check is the crew introduction; a subsequent call opens the Sinfrontera National Bank storyline.",fields:{"Documented story chapter":"3","Documented appearances":"First Impressions; Credit Check; Sinfrontera National Bank"},relations:["karim","andrea","jason-duval","lucia-caminos"]},andrea:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/andrea/",text:"Already part of Raul\u2019s team before meeting the protagonists, Andrea handles coordination and takes part in field assignments. In The Missing Link she adopts the name Maria, with Lucia posing as her cousin Izzy. Her earlier career and surname are undocumented.",fields:{Occupation:"Crew communications and coordination","Documented alias":"Maria (undercover identity)","Documented appearances":"First Impressions; Credit Check; The Missing Link"},relations:["raul-bautista","lucia-caminos","omar-dawoud"]},ernesto:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/ernesto/",text:"Ernesto is heard by telephone in Bricked Up, warning Raymond about approaching police. Raymond suspects him of informing, but that accusation is not confirmed. GTABase associates Ernesto with San4San; PowerPyx leaves his occupation open.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Bricked Up","Appearance type":"Telephone dialogue","Occupation evidence":"Disputed between community sources; not established"},relations:["raymond"],clarifiedDescription:"A contact heard warning Raymond during Bricked Up. Community guides disagree about his precise occupation and affiliation."},raymond:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/raymond/",text:"Boobie sends Jason and Lucia to Raymond\u2019s operation in Chapter 3. Their collection in Bricked Up is interrupted by a police raid; a telephone warning from Ernesto is part of the encounter.",fields:{"Documented mission":"Bricked Up","Documented story chapter":"3",Location:"Venture Apartments"},relations:["boobie-ike","ernesto","jason-duval","lucia-caminos"]},"mia-caminos":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/mia-caminos",text:"When Lucia reconnects with her mother in Vice City, Mia has recently established a property business. Mami Knows Best introduces her first listing. She is also Tommy\u2019s grandmother.",fields:{Occupation:"Real estate agent","Documented mission":"Mami Knows Best",Family:"Lucia Caminos (daughter); Tomas Caminos (grandson)"},relations:["lucia-caminos","tommy-tomas"]},"randy-kozlov":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/randy",text:"Randy offers an optional mission series. GTABase connects its concluding assignment to the Supply & Demand achievement.",fields:{"Related achievement":"Supply & Demand","Mission category":"Strangers & Freaks"}},"tyrone-russo":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/tyrone",text:"Tyrone buys illicit goods from the protagonists and offers his own optional assignments. Finishing his mission strand earns Spin On This!, according to GTABase.",fields:{Occupation:"Fence and drug dealer","Related achievement":"Spin On This!","Mission category":"Strangers & Freaks"}},dunk:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/dunk",text:"Dunk lives in a trailer in Port Gellhorn. Vicki directs Lucia to him during Girls\u2019 Trip; he later helps with Jason\u2019s medication in Slam Dunk and becomes a buyer of stolen goods.",fields:{Location:"Port Gellhorn","Documented appearances":"Girls\u2019 Trip; Slam Dunk",Occupation:"Drug dealer and fence"},relations:["vicki","lucia-caminos","jason-duval"]},"alvan-west":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/alvan-west",text:"Alvan answers the Kelly County Tip Line advertised on missing-person notices. Investigating the notices at the Starlet Motel in Chapter 2 begins his optional storyline, which contributes to Strangers & Freaks completion.",fields:{Affiliation:"Kelly County Tip Line","Documented appearances":"Gellhorn\u2019s Missing Tourists; Missing Persons",Location:"Port Gellhorn","Related achievement":"Strangers & Freaks"}},kirk:{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/characters/kirk",text:"Kirk pursues a creature he calls Mr. Mangrove in the wetlands and claims its pollen caused his disfigurement. The three-part quest involving the creature and tree effigies contributes to the Strangers & Freaks achievement.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Search for the Skunk Ape; Search for Tree Effigies; Help Kirk Find Mr. Mangrove","Related achievement":"Strangers & Freaks","Personal account":"Claims exposure to Skunk Ape pollen"}},"bae-luxe":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/bae-luxe/",text:"Her individual credits distinguish her from her musical partner Roxy. Studio recording in Dealer\u2019s Choice, the booking dispute in Top Billing, the Cooties video and the Headliners show form her documented music storyline. No independent solo discography is established.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Dealer\u2019s Choice; Top Billing; Cooties; Headliners","Musical group":"Real Dimez","Record label":"Only Raw Records"},relations:["roxy-rashad","drequan-priest","boobie-ike","dwnply"]},"roxy-rashad":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/roxy-rashad/",text:"During Top Billing, Roxy leaves after objecting to the opportunities offered to DWNPLY. The ensuing party sequence is specific to her rather than a shared action by both members. She later takes part in the video and launch-show storyline.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Top Billing; Cooties; Headliners","Musical group":"Real Dimez","Record label":"Only Raw Records"},relations:["bae-luxe","drequan-priest","dwnply","jacki"]},dwnply:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/dwnply/",text:"An earlier recording with Real Dimez helped the pair reach a larger audience. The booking conflict in Top Billing and the interruption at Headliners turn that working relationship into a rivalry. Denzel Curry is the credited performer, not the character\u2019s established legal name.",fields:{Occupation:"Rapper","Documented appearances":"Top Billing; Headliners"},relations:["bae-luxe","roxy-rashad","bush"]},"boobie-ike":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/boobie-ike/",text:"Boobie\u2019s property network includes Bayside Apartments, where the protagonists move after Welcome to Vice City. In Boobie Time, Jason meets him at Jack of Hearts in Crosstown and is introduced to Yasmani through the subsequent work.",fields:{Businesses:"Jack of Hearts; property holdings; recording studio; Only Raw Records","Documented appearances":"Welcome to Vice City; Boobie Time",Location:"Crosstown, Vice City"},relations:["drequan-priest","yasmani-cabrera","jason-duval","lucia-caminos"]},"yago-jimenez":{source:"https://www.gtabase.com/gta-6/strangers/join-a-street-race",text:"Yago is introduced in the optional street-racing strand, which begins with Join a Street Race in Salton. The subsequent Bumper to Bumper and Brother to Brother jobs continue his storyline.",fields:{"Documented appearances":"Join a Street Race; Bumper to Bumper; Brother to Brother",Location:"Salton","Mission category":"Strangers & Freaks"}},joey:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/joey/",text:"Jason meets Joey at Coastal Auto Care in Just a Scratch, where his Ganado \u201970 is repaired. Joey then becomes available as a phone contact; business ownership is not established.",fields:{Workplace:"Coastal Auto Care, Key Lento","Documented mission":"Just a Scratch","Contact availability":"Phone contact after introduction"},relations:["jason-duval"]},"dodo-noah":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/dodo-noah/",text:"Noah represents Dodos Rising at the airport-area laboratory protest. His assignment, Bring Out the Chimp, involves documenting captive animals and helping remove a cage.",fields:{Affiliation:"Dodos Rising","Documented mission":"Bring Out the Chimp","Documented location":"Near Vice City International Airport"}},"evelyn-andrews":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/evelyn-andrews/",text:"The owner of Evelyn Andrews Antiques refuses to appraise the statue in Dubious Provenance, suspecting its legitimacy. Her refusal does not establish whether the object is authentic.",fields:{Business:"Evelyn Andrews Antiques","Documented mission":"Dubious Provenance",Location:"Capri"},relations:["jason-duval","lucia-caminos"]},billy:{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/billy/",text:"Billy leads the Thrillbilly Mud Club crew. The optional strand opens in Chapter 2 and progresses from racing to criminal jobs, including Mall Rats and Hometown Heroes.",fields:{Affiliation:"Thrillbilly Mud Club","Documented story chapter":"2","Documented appearances":"Thrillbillies; Mall Rats; The Impaler; Hometown Heroes"},relations:["brittney","ian","ricky","wyman"]},"mister-mangrove":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/mister-mangrove/",text:"The creature is associated with sightings near Gambit Bay and Cottonmouth Lake. Kirk\u2019s investigation offers branching outcomes; the creature\u2019s biological origin remains undocumented.",fields:{"Also known as":"Skunk Ape","Documented locations":"Gambit Bay; Cottonmouth Lake","Story outcome":"Player-dependent"},relations:["kirk"]},"mother-dodo-yvonne":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/mother-dodo-yvonne/",text:"Lucia encounters the group\u2019s leader at a watchtower during the finale of Dodo, Rise!; a subsequent message is accompanied by a reported $5,000 payment.",fields:{Affiliation:"Leader of Dodos Rising","Documented mission":"Dodo, Rise!","Reported reward":"$5,000 follow-up payment"},relations:["dodo-noah","dodo-rosebud","dodo-tyler","lucia-caminos"]},"shirley-baker":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/shirley-baker/",text:"Shirley lives next to Jason. Her two optional errands involving rum and a scooter are limited to Chapter 1; their disappearance does not establish her later fate.",fields:{Connection:"Jason\u2019s neighbor","Documented mission availability":"Chapter 1 only"},relations:["jason-duval"]},"dodo-rosebud":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/dodo-rosebud/",text:"Rosebud\u2019s animal-rights work focuses on marine life. The Oceanarium protest leads into Sisters of the Sea, involving an orca and an optional search for her crystal.",fields:{Affiliation:"Dodos Rising","Documented mission":"Sisters of the Sea",Location:"Oceanarium"}},"dr-merle":{source:"https://gta6ops.com/story/dr-merle/",text:"Merle presents himself as a researcher and meets the player through the No Flushers campaign. The Final Flush includes a sewage-facility sequence with a lasting stamina reward; his credentials and associated cloning theories are not established.",fields:{Affiliation:"No Flushers","Documented mission":"The Final Flush","Reported gameplay reward":"Permanent stamina increase",Qualifications:"Not verified in this atlas"}}},Fo={"kent-andrews":"https://gta6ops.com/story/kent-andrews/","isabella-brady":"https://gta6ops.com/story/isabella-brady/",cullen:"https://gta6ops.com/story/cullen/","leif-aland":"https://gta6ops.com/story/leif-aland/",alicia:"https://gta6ops.com/story/alicia/","manny-muscles":"https://gta6ops.com/story/manny-muscles/",hank:"https://gta6ops.com/story/hank/","hugo-el-capitan":"https://gta6ops.com/story/hugo-el-capitan/","drunk-aussie":"https://gta6ops.com/story/drunk-aussie/"};const Go={"AFROBANK FM":"African music and amapiano","BACK COUNTRY RADIO":"Country","CIRCOLOCO RECORDS RADIO":"House and techno","COCOTEO FM":"Lati